### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@secret = caseda-anne-toksik

### List all subscriptions
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/webhooks
X-Secret: {{secret}}

### Reconcile (re-register missing, sync local table)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/webhooks/sync
X-Secret: {{secret}}

### Test a webhook
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/webhooks/test
X-Secret: {{secret}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "webhookId": 147896,
  "endpoint": "games",
  "entityId": 1337
}

### Unregister a webhook by ID
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/webhooks/145681
X-Secret: {{secret}}
